Z||000006||oneof547||02-11-2001||01:09 AM||||Unfortunately I thought I would have to do as many of you have suggested and that is disassemble relube the poly bushings, this time I think Ill spend $5.oo more and get sum XTRA teflon Grease. I do think that even with all this hassle those bushings or any of the upgrade bushings make an incredible difference whenther cruising or getin down to business. Thanks for all of your input much appreciated as always ill let ya know how it turns out in a week or two. ||||reg||4
